msgid ""
"Use templates to create polished, professional quotes in minutes.\n"
"                Send these quotes by email and let your customers sign "
"online.\n"
"                Use cross-selling and discounts to push and boost your sales."
msgstr ""
"Bir necha daqiqada mukammal, professional kotirovkalar yaratish uchun "
"shablonlardan foydalaning. Bu kotirovkalarni elektron pochta orqali yuboring "
"va mijozlaringizga onlayn imzolash imkonini bering. Savdoni rag‘batlantirish "
"va ko‘paytirish uchun qo‘shimcha sotuvlar va chegirmalardan foydalaning."
